Z||000003||Tigger||10-11-2000||03:08 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Raydar:<BR><B>The real pi$$er is that they probably decided to forego yours in order to include yet another article on bolt-on stuff for a small-block Chevy.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I noticed that too just before I let my subscription run out.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Those articles I agree are great, but all you need to do is grab a Summit, Jegs or similar catalog, pick up the phone and have a credit card handy, oh and wait a few days.<P>The thing is they put two pages of comments people wrote to them and give snide remarks in return.  Some are funny, but it gets old.<P>Did anyone see the article on "Big Daddy" Ed Roth's Beaknik Bandit II earlier this year?  Were the pictures blurry?  Mine where, and they were the only blurry pictures in the whole mag, I thought that was interesting.  Boy can you feel the love there.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">           <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A>  <p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 10-11-2000).]||||reg||1
